[UTCTime "21:41:11"]
[Orientation "black"]
[ChapterMode "gamebook"]

{ The Caro-Kann Exchange Variation is when White captures on d5, exchanging White's e pawn for Black's c pawn. }
1. e4 { What is the move in this position to set up the Caro-Kann? } 1... c6 2. d4 { White takes the center with 2.d4. What is Black's response to play the Caro-Kann defense? } 2... d5 3. exd5 { White decides to take. What move recaptures the pawn? } 3... cxd5 { That is the Caro-Kann Exchange Variation. } (3... Qxd5?! { The move Qxd5 leaves Black with a Scandinavian, just with an awkward c pawn. cxd5 is +0.3, while Qxd5 is +0.8 for White. }) *

