{ The Caro-Kann Defense: Fantasy Variation is one of the most formidable defenses against the Caro-Kann. White plays 3. f3 in response to 2...d5 and hopes to have two pawns in the center after a pawn trade on the e4 square. }
1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. f3 { This is the Caro-Kann: Fantasy Variation. Try to find the best move here. } 3... e6 4. Nc3 Bb4 { That is how to defend against the Fantasy variation! } *

